# Global Rules

## Code Style
- Node.js / CommonJS only (`require` / `module.exports`)
- Async/await preferred over raw promises
- No tests — solo project, prioritise simplicity and reliability
- Error handling: minimal but informative — enough context to diagnose, never swallow silently, never over-log
- Never hardcode keys — always `process.env.VARIABLE_NAME`
- Make every change as simple as possible, minimal blast radius
- Find root causes, not temporary fixes

## Shared Utilities
Always check `/shared` before creating any new API client or utility. Existing clients: Shopify, Supabase, Google Sheets, Claude API. Use them. Don't duplicate them.

## Environment
- Local: `.env` file
- GitHub Actions: GitHub Secrets

Never modify any `CONTEXT.md` file.
